---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Watch a Free HVAC Lesson | Ron Walker's Teaching Style"
  description="Watch Ron Walker explain the basic refrigeration cycle in a free public video, then see how the current 27-module HVAC Boot Camp works."
>
  <div class="standard-page">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Watch Ron teach</p>
        <h1>See how Ron explains <span>an HVAC idea.</span></h1>
        <p>Before choosing a course, hear the instructor for yourself. This public lesson introduces the basic refrigeration cycle. Watch free, without an account.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#watch">Watch the lesson</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Explore Boot Camp</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section" id="watch" aria-labelledby="lesson-title">
      <div class="page-shell preview-split">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Free public video</p>
          <h2 id="lesson-title">The basic refrigeration cycle</h2>
          <p>Listen to Ron's explanation and decide whether his teaching style works for you. You can also <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27uCRQ3B8r4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">watch the lesson on YouTube ↗</a>.</p>
          <p class="preview-boundary"><strong>About the paid course:</strong> HVAC Boot Camp is currently a 27-module Moodle course with textbook reading, Ron's teaching videos, and quizzes. This public video shows Ron teaching; it does not provide paid-course access.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="video-frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/27uCRQ3B8r4?rel=0" title="Basic Refrigeration Cycle lesson by Ron Walker" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <div class="page-shell preview-split">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Ready to see the course?</p>
          <h2 id="next-title">Review Boot Camp before enrolling.</h2>
          <p>See the curriculum, textbook requirement, and payment options so you know what to expect. Online lessons can help you understand systems; safe field skills require practice under supervision.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Explore the course</a><a class="button button-outline-dark" href="/pricing/">See pricing</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-card"><p class="eyebrow">How Boot Camp works</p><div><strong>Study</strong><span>Read the required textbook and watch Ron's videos</span></div><div><strong>Check</strong><span>Use quizzes as you progress through 27 modules</span></div><div><strong>Practice</strong><span>Bring what you learn into supervised field training</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
